### Default well

```tsx

<Well>
  Interest rates are subject to change. Check the current rate before applying.
</Well>
```

### White well

```tsx
<Well color="white">
  Your application has been saved and can be completed later.
</Well>
```

### Nested well

```tsx
<Well>
  Important information
  <Well color="white" className="mt-2">
    Fees and charges may apply.
  </Well>
</Well>
```

### Tags

```tsx
<Well tag="aside">
  This information may help you compare your options.
</Well>
```
